!**********************************************************************
! SWASH 니어쇼어(fine) run — SWAN 스펙트럼 경계 read → 위상해상 처오름
! 명령 구조 근거: models/SWASH/manual-notes/swash-user-manual.md (§4)
!                 models/SWASH/source-analysis/swash-boundary-spectral-transfer.md
!                 models/SWASH/source-analysis/swash-wetting-drying-runup.md
! <...> = 케이스별 치환 placeholder
!**********************************************************************
PROJECT 'nshr' '01'

SET LEVEL=0.0 NAUTICAL
MODE NONSTATIONARY TWODIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES SPHERICAL CCM             ! SWAN coarse run과 동일 좌표계

! --- 고해상 니어쇼어 계산격자 (수 m) ---
CGRID REGULAR <xpc> <ypc> <alpc> <xlenc> <ylenc> <mxc> <myc>
VERTICAL 3                            ! 다층(K=3) — 비정수압 분산 표현(층↑→깊은물 정확)

! --- 수심 (고해상) ---
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR <xpinp> <ypinp> 0 <mxinp> <myinp> <dxinp> <dyinp>
READINP BOTTOM 1.0 'bathy_fine.bot' 3 0 FREE

! --- ★ 경계: SWAN coarse 의 nest 스펙트럼 파일 read ---
! SwashBCspecfile 의 SWAN-포맷 분기(:281-911)가 swan_spec.dat 를 파싱,
! random-phase Fourier 성분으로 시계열 합성. (lnest = SWAN nesting)
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP PEAK DSPR POWER
BOUNDCOND SIDE N BTYPE WEAKREFL CONSTANT SPECFILE 'swan_spec.dat'
!  ↑ 외해측(N) 경계에 SWAN 스펙트럼, weakly-reflective

! --- 물리 ---
BREAKING                              ! bore-front 쇄파 판정 (SwashBreakPoint)
FRICTION MANNING 0.019
NONHYDROSTATIC BOX 1.0                ! 비정수압 압력 projection (분산의 정의적 메커닉)

! --- 수치 ---
DISCRETIZATION UPWIND MOMENTUM
TIMEINTEGRATION METHOD EXPLICIT 0.5   ! CFL 기반

! --- 출력: 처오름·파고·침수 ---
QUANTITY RUNUP                        ! SwashRunupHeight
POINTS 'gauge' FILE 'gauges.loc'
TABLE 'gauge' HEADER 'runup.tbl' TSEC WATLEV RUNUP
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEADER 'hsig.mat' LAY-OUT 3 HSIG SETUP

COMPUTE <tstart> <dt> <tend>
STOP
